{"id":"2fcb0991a92b14d0","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-strongest-condition.md","title":"ZFC Strongest Condition","display":"df-zfc-strongest-condition — ZFC Strongest Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-strongest-condition","aliases":["58-df-zfc-strongest-condition"],"display":"df-zfc-strongest-condition — ZFC Strongest Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-strongest-condition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-strongest-condition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-strongest-condition — ZFC Strongest Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0308c920cba2bdd\" href=\"?note=e0308c920cba2bdd\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Preorder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Preorder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0308c920cba2bdd\" href=\"?note=e0308c920cba2bdd\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongest\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S(s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land s\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongest\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S(s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land s\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under the stronger-than convention, a strongest condition is a least element. The greatest condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span> exported by the forcing-poset atom is instead the weakest condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"e0308c920cba2bdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md","status":"resolved","id":"e0308c920cba2bdd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Preorder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-order6-preorder.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Preorder}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}strongest\\text{-}condition} \\vdash \\mathrm{StrongestCondition}_S(s,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Preorder}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land s\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;(s\\leq_{\\mathbb P}p)","display":true},{"tex":"1_{\\mathbb P}","display":false}],"bytes":1070,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3501","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-strongest-condition.md|58-df-zfc-strongest-condition]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e0308c920cba2bdd"]}